      "name": "Delegation Continuity Across Agent Boundaries",
      "category": "Technology / Governance",
      "requirement": "A downstream agent must not receive or exercise authority broader than the authority validly delegated to the upstream agent, and the delegation chain must remain attributable, bounded, revocable and auditable across every hop.",
